#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:5
#: 5fbbfabcb349474893e6114196278c0e
msgid "Initial Tuning Flight"
msgstr "初始调参飞行"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:8
#: a662dc7a87af4382b55d617ca5080c4b
msgid "Pilot's preparation for first flight"
msgstr "飞手首次飞行前的准备"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:10
#: cdab392e68404145bf9959828bbc9b18
msgid ""
"The first takeoff of an untuned multirotor is the most dangerous seconds of "
"the aircraft’s life. This is where the aircraft could be very unstable "
"causing a sudden increase in power when then results in the aircraft jumping"
" into the air, or it may be so poorly tuned that you have insufficient "
"control over the aircraft once it is airborne. The pilot should be extremely"
" diligent during the tuning flights to avoid a situation that could result "
"in injury or damage."
msgstr ""
"未调参多旋翼的首次起飞是飞机一生中最危险的时刻。此时飞机可能非常不稳定，导致功率突然升高，进而使飞机急速跃升；也可能因调参太差而导致飞机离地后失去控制。飞手在调参飞行期间必须格外谨慎，以避免可能造成伤害或损坏的情况。"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:12
#: a1b84cd549314dc6afebaab0a494dde3
msgid ""
"There are several things that the pilot can do to minimise the risk during "
"the early tuning process:"
msgstr "飞手可以采取以下几项措施来降低早期调参过程中的风险："

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:14
#: e454e879efda41cd8932a3443161326f
msgid ""
"The pilot should conduct a motor number and orientation check (see "
":ref:`Checking the motor numbering with the Mission Planner Motor test "
"<connect-escs-and-motors_testing_motor_spin_directions>`). Care should be "
"taken to ensure that the correct frame type is selected. Incorrect frame "
"type can result in a very fast yaw rotation or complete loss of control. "
"Take note of the output percentage required to spin the propellers and "
"ensure that:"
msgstr ""
"飞手应进行电机编号和方向检查（参见 :ref:`Checking the motor numbering with the Mission "
"Planner Motor test <connect-escs-and-"
"motors_testing_motor_spin_directions>`）。应仔细确认选择了正确的机架类型。错误的机架类型可能导致飞机快速偏航旋转或完全失控。请注意旋转螺旋桨所需的输出百分比，并确保："

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:16
#: bbd7969641294293913e3ec30e494f81
msgid ""
":ref:`MOT_SPIN_ARM <MOT_SPIN_ARM>` is set high enough to spin the motors "
"cleanly."
msgstr ":ref:`MOT_SPIN_ARM <MOT_SPIN_ARM>` 设置得足够高，以确保电机顺畅旋转。"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:17
#: 71987d75790a4017ba337818c2aee63a
msgid ""
":ref:`MOT_SPIN_MIN <MOT_SPIN_MIN>` is set high enough to spin the motors "
"with a minimal level of thrust."
msgstr ":ref:`MOT_SPIN_MIN <MOT_SPIN_MIN>` 设置得足够高，以确保电机以最低推力旋转。"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:19
#: 437716eaeac1483ca39169e8fb4cb742
msgid ""
"All flights after a significant tuning change should be done in Stabilize. "
"Stabilize provides the pilot with significantly more control over the "
"aircraft in the event that the attitude controllers are unstable."
msgstr ""
"每次重大调参变更后的所有飞行均应在Stabilize模式下进行。当姿态控制器不稳定时，Stabilize模式可为飞手提供更多对飞机的控制权。"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:20
#: c8a878d52e894297b2a5f172099805ed
msgid ""
"The pilot should not take off in AltHold until the altitude controller has "
"been tested in flight. This should be done by taking off in Stabilize and "
"switching to Alt Hold. While Alt Hold is rarely a problem unless the "
"aircraft has a very low hover throttle."
msgstr ""
"飞手不应在未经飞行测试高度控制器之前在AltHold模式下起飞。应先在Stabilize模式下起飞，然后切换到AltHold。AltHold模式很少出现问题，除非飞机的悬停油门非常低。"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:21
#: 225a0f3598b347cb85b3bfb08f303889
msgid ""
"For the initial flights the pilot should ensure that these parameters are "
"set:"
msgstr "初次飞行时，飞手应确保这些参数已设置："

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:23
#: 389802bb85a6490ca64c3815a8a264af
msgid ":ref:`ATC_THR_MIX_MAN <ATC_THR_MIX_MAN>` to 0.1"
msgstr ":ref:`ATC_THR_MIX_MAN <ATC_THR_MIX_MAN>` 设置为0.1"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:24
#: fee0f9ea4cf34cdd8f8b9da865ef3b8f
msgid ""
":ref:`MOT_THST_HOVER <MOT_THST_HOVER>` to 0.25 (or lower than the expected "
"hover throttle)"
msgstr ":ref:`MOT_THST_HOVER <MOT_THST_HOVER>` 设置为0.25（或低于预期悬停油门）"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:26
#: 8fa6232f5d0e4d878341b5055267da78
msgid ""
"Use a radio and calibrate the radio correctly (see :ref:`common-radio-"
"control-calibration`)."
msgstr "使用遥控器并正确校准遥控器（参见 :ref:`common-radio-control-calibration`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:27
#: f3c3afaa77a4450f8924a043d6b82a10
msgid ""
"Configure an Emergency Stop Motors switch and test it (see :ref:`Auxiliary "
"Functions <common-auxiliary-functions>`)."
msgstr ""
"配置紧急停止电机开关并进行测试（参见 :ref:`Auxiliary Functions <common-auxiliary-functions>`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:28
#: d16cf504a6f24d1ca57614bb4b8c72ba
msgid ""
"Do tuning flights in low-wind condition and normal weather (no rain and "
"between 15°C/59°F and 25°C/77°F)."
msgstr "在低风条件和正常天气下进行调参飞行（无雨，温度在 15°C/59°F 至 25°C/77°F 之间）。"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:29
#: 21640652e674483d8dec401c5b7227d1
msgid ""
"Practice STABILIZE flight in simulator or on a low-end drone first, you "
"should be confident to be able to takeoff and land with your untuned "
"aircraft."
msgstr "首先在模拟器或低端无人机上练习Stabilize飞行，您应该有信心能够驾驶未调参的飞机起降。"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:33
#: c7a7d10e72a243c3ad1d16aa5d59044e
msgid "First Flight"
msgstr "首次飞行"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:35
#: e6c5aedb6287463f99128f8b95198c31
msgid ""
"The first take off is the most dangerous time for any multirotor. Care must "
"be taken to ensure the aircraft is not destroyed in the first seconds of "
"flight and nobody is injured."
msgstr "首次起飞是任何多旋翼最危险的时刻。必须采取措施确保飞机不在飞行开始的几秒内被损毁，且无人员受伤。"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:37
#: 45064cdda9a440038538411e6c91971f
msgid "**Ensure that all spectators are at a safe distance**."
msgstr "**确保所有旁观者保持安全距离**。"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:38
#: 513d225c4699489b998d1c988db601c1
msgid "**Ensure the pilot is at a safe distance and position**."
msgstr "**确保飞手保持安全距离和位置**。"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:39
#: f2edd81bed114eed9e5299a5bacee3f1
msgid ""
"The pilot should refresh themselves on the method used to disarm the "
"aircraft (using :ref:`Auxiliary Functions <common-auxiliary-functions>` for "
"Motor Interlock or Arm/Disarm may be beneficial)."
msgstr ""
"飞手应复习用于上锁飞机的方法（使用 :ref:`Auxiliary Functions <common-auxiliary-functions>` "
"中的电机互锁或解锁/上锁功能可能有所帮助）。"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:41
#: 7686f7a2aaa440f6a089287e3f2062c1
msgid ""
"This flight will allow to setup your aircraft in a \"flyable for tuning\" "
"state."
msgstr "此飞行将使您能够将飞行器设置为「可飞行以进行调参」状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:43
#: c039b16c610a4bf6a344fe42496cb1d0
msgid "Ensure the aircraft is in STABILIZE mode"
msgstr "确保飞机处于Stabilize模式"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:44
#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:46
#: 4762fa47d7284f60a20fb019c1ad12a8 b2ae1636cac243ffa6a7ccb50f317697
msgid "Arm the aircraft"
msgstr "解锁飞机"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:45
#: 3885cef6867947c3bf0b496ecfe9ef09
msgid ""
"Immediately disarm the aircraft to ensure your disarm procedure is correct"
msgstr "立即上锁飞行器，以确认您的上锁程序正确"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:47
#: c6bc18c7627844daa5144772e401f316
msgid ""
"Slowly increase the throttle looking for signs of oscillation. (long or "
"flexible landing gear may cause some landing gear oscillation that will only"
" go away after the aircraft leaves the ground)"
msgstr "缓慢增加油门，观察是否出现振荡。（较长或较软的起落架可能导致一些起落架振荡，这些振荡只有在飞机离地后才会消失。）"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:48
#: f7afeca9494546d98e5fb47915b822ce
msgid ""
"As soon as the aircraft lifts off the ground immediately put the aircraft "
"back down as gently as possible"
msgstr "飞行器一旦离地，立即尽可能轻柔地让飞行器降落"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:49
#: a0a4d55ae094452689591736368f80c5
msgid "Disarm the aircraft"
msgstr "上锁飞机"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:50
#: cbdc23a3c4df4a0199b1d0f9a02836ff
msgid ""
"Evaluate what you observed to decide if you need to make adjustments to the "
"tuning parameters or if it is safe to take off again"
msgstr "评估观察到的情况，决定是否需要调整调参参数，或者是否可以安全地再次起飞"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:51
#: 602404e5c8864555b6ccace01315aabe
msgid "Arm and increase the throttle to initiate a takeoff"
msgstr "解锁并增加油门以启动起飞"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:52
#: 59002bd67ff34a55a5a5cc9828759eb3
msgid ""
"Hover at approximately 1m altitude and apply small (5 degrees) control "
"inputs into roll and pitch"
msgstr "在约 1m 高度悬停，并施加小幅（5 度）的横滚和俯仰控制输入"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:53
#: 59c70de420394610ad84f85d1dd2eb5b
msgid "Immediately land if any oscillation is observed"
msgstr "一旦观察到任何振荡，立即降落"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:55
#: c901b7dfd46a406da8ecaaa358f099ac
msgid "Next section will explain how to remove the oscillations."
msgstr "下一节将说明如何消除振荡。"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:58
#: 3d22950abc6c4c2fa0d07351cb0aa172
msgid "Initial aircraft tune"
msgstr "初始飞机调参"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:60
#: 807101db0ded4a5b833ab441fd7dfed2
msgid ""
"The first priority when tuning an multirotor aircraft is to establish a "
"stable tune, free of oscillations, that can be used to do further tests."
msgstr "调参多旋翼飞机的首要任务是建立一个稳定、无振荡的调参基础，以便进行进一步测试。"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:62
#: 7611193debb047b298235c828871e9d6
msgid "Arm the aircraft in STABILIZE"
msgstr "在Stabilize模式下解锁飞机"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:63
#: 5ff365f79ab74f559244220fe40db01d
msgid "Increase the throttle slowly until the aircraft leaves the ground"
msgstr "缓慢增加油门直到飞行器离地"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:64
#: 358b2b6650ce439ca880682264f72105
msgid ""
"If the aircraft starts to oscillate immediately abort the takeoff and/or "
"land the aircraft"
msgstr "如果飞机开始振荡，立即中止起飞和/或降落飞机"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:65
#: 9c9088a396484d27a218e8c54c6b563a
msgid "Reduce all the following parameters by 50%"
msgstr "将以下所有参数减少 50%"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:67
#: 2584f53cceec4c1084dc25af58cddac9
msgid ":ref:`ATC_RAT_PIT_P <ATC_RAT_PIT_P__AC_AttitudeControl_Multi>`"
msgstr ":ref:`ATC_RAT_PIT_P <ATC_RAT_PIT_P__AC_AttitudeControl_Multi>`"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:68
#: 98575bac059d4a7b903e2193b090be7d
msgid ":ref:`ATC_RAT_PIT_I <ATC_RAT_PIT_I__AC_AttitudeControl_Multi>`"
msgstr ":ref:`ATC_RAT_PIT_I <ATC_RAT_PIT_I__AC_AttitudeControl_Multi>`"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:69
#: 4e5183a0ddc54e89b016deecb5d2b8af
msgid ":ref:`ATC_RAT_PIT_D <ATC_RAT_PIT_D__AC_AttitudeControl_Multi>`"
msgstr ":ref:`ATC_RAT_PIT_D <ATC_RAT_PIT_D__AC_AttitudeControl_Multi>`"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:70
#: 2f23968e0ce74c26b84bb05349411245
msgid ":ref:`ATC_RAT_RLL_P <ATC_RAT_RLL_P__AC_AttitudeControl_Multi>`"
msgstr ":ref:`ATC_RAT_RLL_P <ATC_RAT_RLL_P__AC_AttitudeControl_Multi>`"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:71
#: dde5887781e649b6be5d888cf7dec267
msgid ":ref:`ATC_RAT_RLL_I <ATC_RAT_RLL_I__AC_AttitudeControl_Multi>`"
msgstr ":ref:`ATC_RAT_RLL_I <ATC_RAT_RLL_I__AC_AttitudeControl_Multi>`"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:72
#: 5462f8edd041409ea2a24529b6410081
msgid ":ref:`ATC_RAT_RLL_D <ATC_RAT_RLL_D__AC_AttitudeControl_Multi>`"
msgstr ":ref:`ATC_RAT_RLL_D <ATC_RAT_RLL_D__AC_AttitudeControl_Multi>`"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:74
#: 76064030264b48c5a6923fe77f09ff14
msgid ""
"This process is repeated until the aircraft can hover without oscillations "
"being detectable visually or audibly."
msgstr "重复此过程，直到飞机能够悬停而目视或听觉均无法察觉到振荡为止。"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:76
#: 5d3db7446b0a4465a81b0fd163db1e84
msgid ""
"If the aircraft has very long or flexible landing gear then you may need to "
"leave the ground before ground resonance stops."
msgstr "如果飞行器的起落架非常长或非常柔软，您可能需要在地面共振停止前先离地。"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:78
#: a41a68af1b8a46389f6878c633443882
msgid ""
"Be aware that in this state the aircraft may be very slow to respond to "
"large control inputs and disturbances. The pilot should be extremely careful"
" to put minimal stick inputs into the aircraft to avoid the possibility of a"
" crash."
msgstr "请注意，在这种状态下，飞行器对大的控制输入和扰动的响应可能非常迟缓。飞手应极其谨慎地向飞行器施加最小的摇杆输入，以避免坠机的可能。"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:81
#: 891d3c59cdfc403b9726dd64f1ebd847
msgid "Test AltHold"
msgstr "测试AltHold"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:83
#: 6926a8b76080439c9b515fc2d1518d18
msgid ""
"This test will allow to test the altitude controller and ensure the "
"stability of your aircraft."
msgstr "此测试将允许测试高度控制器并确保飞行器的稳定性。"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:85
#: 86fe088c60ef40438c606881f9a7b5e9
msgid ""
"Check :ref:`MOT_HOVER_LEARN <MOT_HOVER_LEARN>` is set to 2. This will allow "
"the controller to learn by itself the correct hover value when flying."
msgstr ""
"检查 :ref:`MOT_HOVER_LEARN <MOT_HOVER_LEARN>` 是否设置为2。这将允许控制器在飞行时自主学习正确的悬停值。"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:87
#: deb963728a59476b80c28d9c5865b78d
msgid ""
"Take off in STABILIZE and increase altitude to 5m. Switch to AltHold and be "
"ready to switch back to STABILIZE. If the aircraft is hovering at a very low"
" hover throttle value you may hear a reasonably fast oscillation in the "
"motors. Ensure the aircraft has spent at least 30 seconds in hover to let "
"the hover throttle parameter converge to the correct value. Land and disarm "
"the aircraft."
msgstr ""
"在Stabilize模式下起飞并爬升至5m高度。切换到AltHold，随时准备切换回Stabilize。如果飞机在非常低的悬停油门下悬停，您可能会听到电机发出相对较快的振荡声。确保飞机在悬停状态下至少保持30秒，使悬停油门参数收敛到正确值。降落并上锁飞机。"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:89
#: 0771dfabe4dc4d89b74bcf8a9dea401a
msgid ""
"Set these parameters on ground and preferably disarm (A confident pilot "
"could set them in flight with GCS or CH6 tuning knob):"
msgstr "在地面上设置这些参数，最好在上锁状态下进行（有经验的飞手可在飞行中通过地面站或 CH6 调参旋钮设置）："

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:91
#: 25b8ceb2eda1490e887794cabd56d410
msgid ""
":ref:`PSC_D_ACC_I<PSC_D_ACC_I>` to 0.2 x :ref:`MOT_THST_HOVER "
"<MOT_THST_HOVER>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`PSC_D_ACC_I<PSC_D_ACC_I>` 设为 0.2 × :ref:`MOT_THST_HOVER "
"<MOT_THST_HOVER>`"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:92
#: 03b41eda6dd74585a03b4cc3da51d054
msgid ""
":ref:`PSC_D_ACC_P<PSC_D_ACC_P>` to 0.1 x :ref:`MOT_THST_HOVER "
"<MOT_THST_HOVER>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`PSC_D_ACC_P<PSC_D_ACC_P>` 设为 0.1 × :ref:`MOT_THST_HOVER "
"<MOT_THST_HOVER>`"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:94
#: e64f3367f1c743d4a5880a54bfc8347e
msgid ""
"In Copter 4.6 and earlier these parameters were named ``PSC_ACCZ_I`` and "
"``PSC_ACCZ_P`` and were scaled 10x larger:"
msgstr ""
"在 Copter 4.6 及更早版本中，这些参数名为 ``PSC_ACCZ_I`` 和 ``PSC_ACCZ_P``，且数值缩放大 10 倍："

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:96
#: e8478ca3824442479f60c25b32105167
msgid ""
":ref:`PSC_D_ACC_I<PSC_D_ACC_I>` to 2 x :ref:`MOT_THST_HOVER "
"<MOT_THST_HOVER>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`PSC_D_ACC_I<PSC_D_ACC_I>` 设为 2 × :ref:`MOT_THST_HOVER "
"<MOT_THST_HOVER>`"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:97
#: 72dc0454720c4436821282a40b52031e
msgid ""
":ref:`PSC_D_ACC_P<PSC_D_ACC_P>` to :ref:`MOT_THST_HOVER <MOT_THST_HOVER>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`PSC_D_ACC_P<PSC_D_ACC_P>` 设为 :ref:`MOT_THST_HOVER <MOT_THST_HOVER>`"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:99
#: 1fdad9b59e3a49c78d3627322be5f089
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"if AltHold starts to oscillate up and down the position and velocity "
"controllers may need to be reduced by 50%. These values are: "
":ref:`PSC_D_POS_P<PSC_D_POS_P>` and :ref:`PSC_D_VEL_P<PSC_D_VEL_P>`."
msgstr ""
"如果AltHold开始出现上下振荡，位置和速度控制器可能需要减小50%。这些值为：:ref:`PSC_POSZ_P <PSC_POSZ_P>` 和 "
":ref:`PSC_VELZ_P <PSC_VELZ_P>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:101
#: 678472e83fd2492ab4c5333cc4ef6ea4
msgid ""
"In Copter 4.6 and earlier :ref:`PSC_D_VEL_P<PSC_D_VEL_P>` was named "
"``PSC_VELZ_P`` and :ref:`PSC_D_POS_P<PSC_D_POS_P>` was named ``PSC_POSZ_P``."
msgstr ""
"在 Copter 4.6 及更早版本中，:ref:`PSC_D_VEL_P<PSC_D_VEL_P>` 名为 "
"``PSC_VELZ_P``，:ref:`PSC_D_POS_P<PSC_D_POS_P>` 名为 ``PSC_POSZ_P``。"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:104
#: 1e3e3273082a4f19bb9272e472357290
msgid "Harmonic Notch Filtering"
msgstr "谐波陷波滤波"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:106
#: a617d2a9db80419bb43fc22b198bbedf
msgid ""
"After you have a hover without oscillations the next step is to get get a "
"good notch filter setup to reduce noise to the  PID controllers. A good set "
"of notch filtering parameters is critical to a good tune."
msgstr "在实现无振荡悬停之后，下一步是设置好陷波滤波器，以降低传入PID控制器的噪声。一套良好的陷波滤波参数对于良好的调参至关重要。"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:111
#: 676fc11da7ba47698160ba41198776f4
msgid ""
"To get a notch filter setup you need to hover your vehicle for at least 30 "
"seconds with no pilot input and with "
":ref:`INS_LOG_BAT_MASK<INS_LOG_BAT_MASK>` set to 1. This will enable FFT "
"logging which will guide the correct setup of the notch filters. You should "
"then carefully read the :ref:`common-imu-notch-filtering` documentation and "
"setup a harmonic notch to remove the noise from your gyros."
msgstr ""
"要设置陷波滤波器，您需要在将 :ref:`INS_LOG_BAT_MASK<INS_LOG_BAT_MASK>` "
"设置为1的情况下，让飞行器在无飞手输入的情况下悬停至少30秒。这将启用FFT日志记录功能，用于指导正确设置陷波滤波器。然后，您应仔细阅读 "
":ref:`common-imu-notch-filtering` 文档，并设置谐波陷波以消除陀螺仪的噪声。"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-tuning-flight.rst:115
#: 19810ad7ef10440ea46718e14b53387a
msgid ""
"Eliminating noise with the notch filters will dramatically improve the "
"quality of your tune."
msgstr "使用陷波滤波器消除噪声将大幅提高调参质量。"
